  triage:title "AckRequest::reply_body raw String field — validation deferred deep in call chain" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/ack/mod.rs:28 — AckRequest struct has reply_body: String field with no validation at construction site. Validation is deferred deep in the call chain, allowing invalid values to propagate. Should use a newtype or validate at construction." ;
